# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Capture-derived replication data (PRIVACY - do not publish)
# These are decoded from real match captures and contain other players' data:
# real_replay_stream.json src 21 carries a third party's SteamID64 and the
# owner's in-game handle. Same policy as captures/README.md: capture data and
# anything derived byte-for-byte from it stays out of the public repository.
# Share out-of-band with collaborators who need to run the match server.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
match_server/real_replay_stream.json
match_server/real_spawn_bunches.json
match_server/real_pawn_bunches.json
match_server/replayout_table.json
match_server/pawn_ch3_stream.json
match_server/capturepoint_stream.json
match_server/capturepoint_export_stream.json
match_server/ownership_bootstrap.json
match_server/live_log/
**/session_*.jsonl

